      <p>{"{"}{"{"} SMProductName {"}"}{"}"} provides a platform for behavioral insight and operational control over your networked microservices in a service mesh. With {"{"}{"{"} SMProductName {"}"}{"}"}, you can connect, secure, and monitor microservices in your OpenShift Container Platform environment.</p>
      <p class="/modules/ossm-understanding-service-mesh.md"></p>
      <p class="/modules/ossm-architecture.md"></p>
      <p>For information about how to install the 3scale adapter, refer to the <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/service_mesh/v2x/threescale-adapter#threescale-adapter">3scale Istio adapter documentation</a></p>
      <h2 id="_understanding_kiali" class="group scroll-mt-20">Understanding Kiali<a href="#_understanding_kiali" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
